	'si_ok_h' => 'Suitable',
	'si_s1_b' => 'Office car parks are ideal environments for workplace EV charging. Staff vehicles typically remain parked for seven to nine hours during office working shifts, allowing steady 7.4 kW charging without demanding excessive electrical current. Units can be mounted directly along external building perimeters or on concrete structural columns inside covered parking areas. Because employee arrivals and departures follow consistent schedules, Lena Brandt can model charging loads against building HVAC and lighting cycles. This predictable dwell time makes workplace charging convenient for commuting staff while keeping building energy demands balanced throughout the working week.',
	'si_s1_h' => 'Offices and Staff Car Parks',
	'si_s2_b' => 'Commercial van depots, distribution hubs, and service yards require dependable overnight or between-shift charging. Commercial fleet vans return to base in the late afternoon and remain stationed until early morning routes commence. Ground-mounted twin posts placed along kerb islands or yard perimeters charge two commercial vehicles simultaneously from a single electrical run. With our €640 load-management module installed, depot managers can stagger charging cycles throughout the night, prioritising vans that depart earliest without overloading the main supply. This predictable routine ensures fleet vans are fully charged and ready for operation every morning.',
	'si_s2_h' => 'Depots and Commercial Fleet Yards',
	'si_s3_b' => 'To ensure successful installations, we maintain clear suitability standards. Suitable sites have dedicated off-street parking, an accessible electrical distribution board within practical cable distance, and vehicle dwell times of at least four hours. Conversely, we do not undertake domestic installations, residential driveways, curbside on-street parking, or motorway rapid-transit hubs requiring high-voltage DC hardware. We also decline sites without dedicated off-street bays or properties where landlord electrical consents cannot be obtained. Maintaining this strict commercial focus allows our team to deliver exceptional engineering quality, durable hardware, and reliable support for commercial workplace operators.',
