	'th_h1' => 'Thank You for Your Request',
	'th_lead' => 'We have received your site assessment enquiry. Our client desk will review your facility details and reply within one working day to confirm survey arrangements.',
	'th_s1_b' => 'Thank you for requesting a workplace charging site assessment from Kodou Charging. Priya Nair at our Northfield client desk is currently reviewing your site address, nominated parking bay count, and preferred appointment weekdays. We will reply within one working day by telephone or email to confirm your exact 90-minute survey slot. During that visit, Tomas Reyes will examine your main switchboard, map practical cable containment routes, and assess bay access without disrupting ongoing facility operations. There is no preliminary preparation required beyond ensuring our assessor can access your electrical intake room on the agreed date.',
	'th_s1_h' => 'What Happens Next With Your Booking',
	'th_s2_b' => 'If you need to adjust your contact details, reschedule an appointment, or provide additional facility information before our visit, please contact our team directly. Our central office and yard are located at Unit 4, 18 Lantern Street, Northfield, and our desk is open Monday to Friday from 08:00 to 17:30. You can reach us by phone on +00 20 7946 0180 or email us at visits@kodou-charging.example. We look forward to visiting your site, providing an honest engineering assessment, and delivering your complete written report and fixed quote within 5 working days.',
	'th_s2_h' => 'Contacting Our Engineering Desk',
	'tm_h1' => 'Terms and Conditions',
	'tm_lead' => 'These terms govern our site assessment surveys, fixed-price quotations, installation contracts, and ongoing maintenance services. We operate transparently with clear timelines, agreed milestones, and defined engineering responsibilities.',
	'tm_s1_b' => 'Site assessments are booked following confirmation from our client desk. The assessment fee of €290 covers facilities with up to 12 parking bays, with each additional 12 bays priced at €120. When an installation agreement is executed, the initial €290 fee is credited in full against the final contract invoice. Following the 90-minute survey, Kodou Charging issues a detailed written technical report and fixed quotation within 5 working days. All quoted pricing remains valid for 60 calendar days from the date of issue, maintaining fixed hardware, cabling, and labour rates during your corporate approval and budgeting cycle.',
	'tm_s1_h' => 'Assessment Booking and Quotation Validity',
	'tm_s2_b' => 'Clients must provide clear physical access to main electrical distribution rooms and agreed parking bays during site surveys and physical installation. On-site installation work typically spans 1 to 3 days depending on bay counts and cable tray complexity. All hardware supplied, including 7.4 kW wall units and twin posts, is installed in strict accordance with national electrical safety codes by certified electricians. Completed works include physical commissioning, insulation resistance testing, and staff operational handovers. Ongoing reliability is supported through our annual service visits, priced at €180 per site plus €25 per unit, which preserve operational standards and ensure statutory electrical compliance.',
	'tm_s2_h' => 'Installation Access and Maintenance Terms',
	'upd_h' => 'Updates',
	'upd_p' => 'Occasional site notes on workplace charging: tariff changes, grid capacity, grant deadlines and new hardware. Nothing else.',
	'util_hours' => 'Office Mon–Fri 08:00–17:30 · Site visits Mon–Sat 07:30–16:00',
	'visit_1' => 'Our site assessor meets your facilities manager at the car park entrance to review daily vehicle patterns, bay access and building requirements. We walk the bays together to identify the best charger locations and check physical clearance.',
	'visit_2' => 'Next, we inspect the main electrical intake and the distribution boards, measuring spare capacity and logging the existing baseline load. We map efficient cable paths along walls and ceilings so the installation stays tidy and unobtrusive.',
	'visit_3' => 'Finally, we record exact bay dimensions, check ground surfaces and assess metering options for company vehicles. Within 5 working days we deliver an engineering report and a fixed quotation that stays valid for 60 days.',
